# benchmarks/

Benchmark implementations for FATORI-V testing and FI campaigns.

## Structure

Each benchmark is a subdirectory with:
- Source files (.c, .h)
- Makefile
- Optional: requirements.yaml (library dependencies)

## Available Benchmarks

coremark/       - CoreMark industry standard benchmark
dhrystone/      - Dhrystone integer performance test
embench/        - Embench-IoT embedded benchmark suite
fatori_stress/  - Custom stress tests with XOR validation
hello_world/    - Simple test benchmark

## Integration

Benchmarks referenced in run YAML via name.
Build system adds: BENCHMARKS_DIR=../../benchmarks/<name>